{# Flash message types
   The notice and error variants match the flash message types commonly used in
   Symfony apps. They look like the info and danger variants. #}
<twig:ea:Alert variant="notice">Your changes were saved as a draft.</twig:ea:Alert>
<twig:ea:Alert variant="error">The file is too big. The maximum size is 10 MB.</twig:ea:Alert>
